{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2807-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>民政署日前（10日）公布「窩仔山優化計劃」，將分階段清除長年設於深水埗主教山的違規構築物，首階段涵蓋棠蔭街山邊休憩處由山腳至山頂範圍，次階段則為近巴域街一帶由山腳至山頂的圍封區域。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2834-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>目前，次階段範圍內仍保留不少健身設施及神像，現場亦有街坊踢毽、打乒乓球及使用健身設備等；至於棠蔭街山邊休憩處一帶，昨晚已架設鐵絲網及圍板，並於今早安排保安駐守，禁止街坊進入。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_3017-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2999-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2938-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2637-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2292-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2304-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2303-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2572-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2651-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2567-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2671-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2667-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2495-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2508-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_2465-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T06:01:08.820692+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":18,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}